      "name": "Structured Output Parser1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a strict email marketing editor and a native speaker of {{ $json.language_name }}.\n\nBRAND VOICE GUIDE\n{{ $('Campaign setup').first().json.brand_voice }}\n\nBRIEF\n- Topic: {{ $('Campaign setup').first().json.topic }}\n- Key points: {{ $('Campaign setup').first().json.key_points }}\n\nAUDIENCE\n- Segment: {{ $json.segment }}: {{ $json.segment_description }}\n- Language: {{ $json.language_name }}, form of address: {{ $json.address_form }}\n\nEMAIL\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nHeadline: {{ $json.headline }}\nBody: {{ $json.body }}\nCTA: {{ $json.cta_label }}\n\nCHECK\n1. Does it sound native and natural in {{ $json.language_name }}, with the right form of address and no grammar errors?\n2. Does it follow the brand voice (no hype, no fake urgency, no emoji)?\n3. Does it contain any claim, number or feature that is NOT in the brief?\n4. Is it angled to what this segment cares about?\n5. Does it use any of these words, or their translations: {{ $('Campaign setup').first().json.banned_words }}\n\nSet pass to false if any check fails. Score overall quality from 1 to 5. List each problem as one short, specific sentence in English. If there are no problems, return an empty list.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {
          "batchSize": 1,
          "delayBetweenBatches": 10000
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        688,
        0
      ],
      "id": "141b9086-ff8f-4c5f-b0a0-24247b2fc4ea",
      "name": "Review email",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const drafts = $('Combine + checks').all();\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const d = drafts[i].json;\n  const r = item.json.output;\n  return { json: {\n    ...d,\n    review_score: r.score,\n    passed: d.hard_issues.length === 0 && r.pass === true,\n    issues: [...d.hard_issues, ...r.issues].join(' | '),\n    rewritten: false,\n  }};\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1056,
